CompilerError:
error E3006: Point/<fragment>:20:17: duplicate definition of function 'Point.create' — a free function of that bare name is declared in more than one DIRECTORY, so each is registered under its directory-qualified spelling, and that spelling is already the mangled name of a method. Rename the directory, or rename the function
